public static <A> F.Promise<java.util.List<A>> sequence(java.lang.Iterable<F.Promise<A>> promises)

Combine the given promises into a single promise for the list of results. The sequencing operations are performed in the default ExecutionContext. Parameters: promises - The promises to combine

